段和唯一王號相合，辨繹，不把外證諱字補進本篇原文。"},{"id":"rvc_bqx_v5w_D","label":"蕭方矩（改名元良，愍懷太子）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"元良","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002:m0070"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002:m0070","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete","quote":"元良"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"蕭方矩（改名元良，愍懷太子），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"rvc_bqx_v5w","source_assertion_id":"a-chen017-yuanliang-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-017","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete-ws1544244","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002","quote":"侯景之亂，梁元帝於荊州承制，沖求解南郡，以讓王僧辯，并獻女妓十人，以助軍賞。元帝授持節、督衡桂成合四州諸軍事、雲麾將軍、衡州刺史。元帝第四子元良為湘州刺史，仍以沖行州事，領長沙內史。侯景平，授翊左將軍、丹陽尹。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002:m0070","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002:m0038","source_term":"元帝第四子元良"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"按本卷本句兩端親稱及所在字位。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete-ws1544244","work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-017","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002:m0070"],"paragraph_ids":["c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002:m0070","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002:m0070"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出